    "content": "A curated, interlinked collection of knowledge pages built from real-world AI projects. This wiki is maintained by an LLM agent and serves as both documentation and a learning resource.\n\n## Wiki Structure\n\n### Haney CLI\nA transparent, configuration-driven terminal AI coding assistant built from scratch. \n- [Introduction](haney-cli/introduction.md)\n- [Architecture](haney-cli/architecture.md)\n- [Commands](haney-cli/commands.md)\n- [Configuration](haney-cli/configuration.md)\n- [MCP Integration](haney-cli/mcp-integration.md)\n- [Tool System](haney-cli/tool-system.md)\n- [Memory System](haney-cli/memory-system.md)\n- [Project Awareness](haney-cli/project-awareness.md)\n- [Design Decisions](haney-cli/design-decisions.md)\n- [Lessons Learned](haney-cli/lessons-learned.md)\n\n### Haney GPT\nA 537M-parameter GPT-style language model trained from scratch on a custom 517M-token corpus.\n- [Project Overview](haney-gpt/project-overview.md)\n- [Model Architecture](haney-gpt/model-architecture.md)\n- [Tokenization Pipeline](haney-gpt/tokenization-pipeline.md)\n- [Training Process](haney-gpt/training-process.md)\n- [Challenges Faced](haney-gpt/challenges-faced.md)\n- [Future Improvements](haney-gpt/future-improvements.md)\n\n### Vectorless RAG\nFull-stack document chat using PostgreSQL full-text search — no vector embeddings needed.\n- [Introduction](vectorless-rag/introduction.md)\n- [Architecture](vectorless-rag/architecture.md)\n- [Retrieval Process](vectorless-rag/retrieval-process.md)\n- [Advantages](vectorless-rag/advantages.md)\n- [Limitations](vectorless-rag/limitations.md)\n\n### Traditional RAG\nModern production-grade RAG platform with semantic retrieval, hybrid search, and LLM evaluation.\n- [Introduction](traditional-rag/introduction.md)\n- [Embedding Pipeline](traditional-rag/embedding-pipeline.md)\n- [Chunking Strategy](traditional-rag/chunking-strategy.md)\n- [Vector Database Workflow](traditional-rag/vector-database-workflow.md)\n- [Retrieval Process](traditional-rag/retrieval-process.md)\n- [Advantages](traditional-rag/advantages.md)\n- [Limitations](traditional-rag/limitations.md)\n\n### AI Ecommerce\nFull-stack ecommerce platform with an AI voice support agent named Haney.\n- [Project Overview](ai-ecommerce/project-overview.md)\n- [Architecture](ai-ecommerce/architecture.md)\n- [AI Features](ai-ecommerce/ai-features.md)\n- [Product Recommendation Flow](ai-ecommerce/product-recommendation-flow.md)\n- [Technical Decisions](ai-ecommerce/technical-decisions.md)\n- [Future Roadmap](ai-ecommerce/future-roadmap.md)"
